<title>USA: TABLE - Trinity Q1 June 30 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Trinity Q1 June 30 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinity Industries Inc.</p>
<p>		    Condensed Consolidated Income Statement</p>
<p>		    (in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								  June 30</p>
<p>								 1997    1996</p>
<p> Revenues						 $  560.1  576.5</p>
<p> Income from continuing operations		    33.2   30.5</p>
<p> Income from discontinued operations		     -    3.3</p>
<p> Net income						   33.2   33.8</p>
<p>Income per common and common equivalent share</p>
<p>  from continuing operations			    0.76   0.72</p>
<p>Income per common and common equivalent share</p>
<p>  from discontinued operations			     -   0.08</p>
