<p>								  0.76   0.80</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common</p>
<p>  equivalent shares outstanding			 43.6   42.1</p>
<p>Note: The company divested its ownership interest in its former subsidiary, Halter Marine Group Inc, on March 31. Trinity's fiscal 1997 results include operating results of Halter as a discontinued operation.</p>
